  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pisto starts with a proper "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "sofrito",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "sofrito"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " base, then the peppers and aubergine are added and allowed to almost "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "confit",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "confit"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in olive oil and tomato over low heat. The result is a deeply sweet, jammy vegetable stew that improves over time."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not rush the onion step. Ten minutes on low heat is the minimum to get the sweetness right."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
